    "salium":
      "A myriad of soft pink saliums border the "
      "shrub rose and palace wall.\n",
  ]);
}

string query_short() { return "The place before the palace"; }

string query_long() {
  return
    "The walls of the main building are right before you. Latticed windows "
    "can be seen all over the basement of the building. To the east is the "
    "entrance of the palace. The mainroad to the south starts there also. "
    "All over the place are beds with artfully aranged flowers and a beautiful cascades "
    "of roses. A beautiful white marble bench is here.\n";
}

string long() { return query_long(); }

string query_exit(string dir) {
  if (!exits || !dir)
    return 0;
  return exits[dir];
}

string query_exit_string() {
  return "The obvious exit is south.\n";
}

string query_item(string s) {
  if (!extras || !s)
    return 0;
  return extras[s];
}

int id(string str) {
  return str == "place" || str == "palace" || str == "here";
}
